    "CommitMsg": "Add Kaakaww! Spring Boot startup banner easter egg (#109)\n\nReplace the default Spring Boot banner with colored ASCII art: a\n\"KAAKAWW!\" figlet wordmark in cyan, the StackHawk hawk-in-shield logo\n(faithfully converted from the brand mark — cyan hawk, gray shield),\nthe \"~ by StackHawk\" tagline, and www.stackhawk.com.\n\nColors use Spring's ${AnsiColor.*} placeholders so they render in a\nTTY and are stripped cleanly in Docker/piped logs (ansi=DETECT).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
    "Author": "Brandon Ward \u003cbrandon.ward@stackhawk.com\u003e",
    "Committer": "GitHub \u003cnoreply@github.com\u003e"
  },
